"] [17592186133934 :knowledge-point/questions "question-2e69b893-dca1-5a00-a0a1-d673b040380f"] ["question-072376b1-6413-51af-98f6-95587e3acbf3" :question/id #uuid "072376b1-6413-51af-98f6-95587e3acbf3"] ["question-072376b1-6413-51af-98f6-95587e3acbf3" :question/math-academy-id "q-44986"] ["question-072376b1-6413-51af-98f6-95587e3acbf3" :question/problem "What is the explicit formula for the $n$th term of the geometric sequence given by\n\n$$\nf(n+1)=\\frac{f(n)}{2},\\,\\,f(1)=\\frac{1}{2},\\,\\,n\\ge 1?\n$$"] ["question-072376b1-6413-51af-98f6-95587e3acbf3" :question/worked-solution "First, let's rewrite our recursive formula, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(n+1)=\\frac{f(n)}{2}=\\frac{1}{2}f(n)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe explicit formula for the $n$th term of a geometric sequence is\n\n$$\nf(n)=f(1)\\cdot {r}^{n-1},\\,n\\ge 1.\n$$\n\nSo, we must determine the first term $f(1)$ and the common ratio $r.$\n\nWe are given that the first term is $f(1)=\\frac{1}{2}.$ To find the common ratio, we compare the given sequence with the general recursive formula for a geometric sequence:\n\n$$\nf(n+1)=r\\cdot f(n)\n$$\n\n \n\nFrom the above, we see that $r=\\frac{1}{2}.$\n\nSubstituting $f(1)=\\frac{1}{2}$ and $r=\\frac{1}{2}$ into the formula for the $n$th term, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(n) & =f(1)\\cdot {r}^{n-1} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot {(\\frac{1}{2})}^{n-1}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can simplify further by manipulating the exponents as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(n) & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot {(\\frac{1}{2})}^{n-1} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot {(\\frac{1}{2})}^{-1}\\cdot {(\\frac{1}{2})}^{n} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\frac{2}{1}\\cdot {(\\frac{1}{2})}^{n} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{{2}^{n}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the formula for the $n$th term is\n\n$$\nf(n)=\\frac{1}{{2}^{n}},\\,n\\ge 1.\n$$"] ["question-072376b1-6413-51af-98f6-95587e3acbf3" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] ["answer-field-9947e7a8-c30a-59fb-977d-989052168899" :answer-field/id #uuid "9947e7a8-c30a-59fb-977d-989052168899"] ["answer-955d3208-98c9-5cd1-a334-320a252d84ee" :answer/id #uuid "955d3208-98c9-5cd1-a334-320a252d84ee"] ["answer-955d3208-98c9-5cd1-a334-320a252d84ee" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-955d3208-98c9-5cd1-a334-320a252d84ee" :answer/value "f(n)=\\frac{1}{{2}^{n-1}},\\,n\\ge 1"] ["answer-2ca374ed-64c4-537e-9df7-38e602f55fd2" :answer/id #uuid "2ca374ed-64c4-537e-9df7-38e602f55fd2"] ["answer-2ca374ed-64c4-537e-9df7-38e602f55fd2" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-2ca374ed-64c4-537e-9df7-38e602f55fd2" :answer/value "f(n)=\\frac{1}{{2}^{n}},\\,n\\ge 1"] ["answer-679a841f-b122-5f85-a654-2b11ecc33553" :answer/id #uuid "679a841f-b122-5f85-a654-2b11ecc33553"] ["answer-679a841f-b122-5f85-a654-2b11ecc33553" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-679a841f-b122-5f85-a654-2b11ecc33553" :answer/value "f(n)=\\frac{1}{{4}^{n}},\\,n\\ge 1"] ["answer-4a4e66bc-7a14-5aba-9a6a-a17f030fcf54" :answer/id #uuid "4a4e66bc-7a14-5aba-9a6a-a17f030fcf54"] ["answer-4a4e66bc-7a14-5aba-9a6a-a17f030fcf54" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-4a4e66bc-7a14-5aba-9a6a-a17f030fcf54" :answer/value "f(n)={2}^{n-1},\\,n\\ge 1"] ["answer-4301ea6f-1c49-5f63-a937-a2c2069919c4" :answer/id #uuid "4301ea6f-1c49-5f63-a937-a2c2069919c4"] ["answer-4301ea6f-1c49-5f63-a937-a2c2069919c4" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-4301ea6f-1c49-5f63-a937-a2c2069919c4" :answer/value "f(n)={2}^{n},\\,n\\ge 1"] ["answer-field-9947e7a8-c30a-59fb-977d-989052168899" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-field-9947e7a8-c30a-59fb-977d-989052168899" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] ["answer-field-9947e7a8-c30a-59fb-977d-989052168899" :answer-field/correct "answer-2ca374ed-64c4-537e-9df7-38e602f55fd2"] ["answer-field-9947e7a8-c30a-59fb-977d-989052168899" :answer-field/choices "answer-955d3208-98c9-5cd1-a334-320a252d84ee"] ["answer-field-9947e7a8-c30a-59fb-977d-989052168899" :answer-field/choices "answer-2ca374ed-64c4-537e-9df7-38e602f55fd2"] ["answer-field-9947e7a8-c30a-59fb-977d-989052168899" :answer-field/choices "answer-679a841f-b122-5f85-a654-2b11ecc33553"] ["answer-field-9947e7a8-c30a-59fb-977d-989052168899" :answer-field/choices "answer-4a4e66bc-7a14-5aba-9a6a-a17f030fcf54"] ["answer-field-9947e7a8-c30a-59fb-977d-989052168899" :answer-field/choices "answer-4301ea6f-1c49-5f63-a937-a2c2069919c4"] ["question-072376b1-6413-51af-98f6-95587e3acbf3" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-9947e7a8-c30a-59fb-977d-989052168899"] [17592186133935 :knowledge-point/questions "question-072376b1-6413-51af-98f6-95587e3acbf3"] ["question-715d8ed0-87e8-5b42-a40f-879649ce1b0d" :question/id #uuid "715d8ed0-87e8-5b42-a40f-879649ce1b0d"] ["question-715d8ed0-87e8-5b42-a40f-879649ce1b0d" :question/math-academy-id "q-44995"] ["question-715d8ed0-87e8-5b42-a40f-879649ce1b0d" :question/problem "The formula for the $n$th term of a geometric sequence is $f(n)=3\\cdot {2}^{n+1}$ for $n\\ge 1.$  What is the recursive formula for this sequence?"] ["question-715d8ed0-87e8-5b42-a40f-879649ce1b0d" :question/worked-solution "The recursive formula for a geometric sequence is\n\n$$\nf(n+1)=r\\cdot f(n).\n$$\n\nTo complete the formula, we must determine the common ratio $r$ and state the first term ${a}_{1}.$ The first two terms are\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(1) & =3\\cdot {2}^{1+1}=3\\cdot 4=12, \\\\ f(2) & =3\\cdot {2}^{2+1}=3\\cdot 8=24.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, the common ratio is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r & =\\frac{f(2)}{f(1)}=\\frac{24}{12}=2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the recursive formula for the geometric  sequence is\n\n$$\nf(n+1)=2f(n),\\,f(1)=12,\\,n\\ge 1.\n$$"] ["question-715d8ed0-87e8-5b42-a40f-879649ce1b0d" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-66bae46d-9a2a-5dcb-a638-46a59f8b52be" :answer-field/id #uuid "66bae46d-9a2a-5dcb-a638-46a59f8b52be"] ["answer-2b933277-b836-55ae-9b21-a1a99505fdc8" :answer/id #uuid "2b933277-b836-55ae-9b21-a1a99505fdc8"] ["answer-2b933277-b836-55ae-9b21-a1a99505fdc8" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-2b933277-b836-55ae-9b21-a1a99505fdc8" :answer/value "f(n+1)=2f(n),\\,f(1)=12,\\,n\\ge 1"] ["answer-9c6698c3-0e55-55e1-a6c5-bc756af04932" :answer/id #uuid "9c6698c3-0e55-55e1-a6c5-bc756af04932"] ["answer-9c6698c3-0e55-55e1-a6c5-bc756af04932" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-9c6698c3-0e55-55e1-a6c5-bc756af04932" :answer/value "f(n+1)=2f(n),\\,f(1)=3,\\,n\\ge 1"] ["answer-71f17afc-b6a1-50e6-8314-cf085641ebf2" :answer/id #uuid "71f17afc-b6a1-50e6-8314-cf085641ebf2"] ["answer-71f17afc-b6a1-50e6-8314-cf085641ebf2" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-71f17afc-b6a1-50e6-8314-cf085641ebf2" :answer/value "f(n+1)=2f(n),\\,f(1)=6,\\,n\\ge 1"] ["answer-227897ea-9dd1-5b96-9c06-008a8a2d99f1" :answer/id #uuid "227897ea-9dd1-5b96-9c06-008a8a2d99f1"] ["answer-227897ea-9dd1-5b96-9c06-008a8a2d99f1" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-227897ea-9dd1-5b96-9c06-008a8a2d99f1" :answer/value "f(n+1)=6f(n),\\,f(1)=12,\\,n\\ge 1"] ["answer-3a562547-fbeb-5f3b-853f-ddbd84961e5d" :answer/id #uuid "3a562547-fbeb-5f3b-853f-ddbd84961e5d"] ["answer-3a562547-fbeb-5f3b-853f-ddbd84961e5d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-3a562547-fbeb-5f3b-853f-ddbd84961e5d" :answer/value "f(n+1)=6f(n),\\,f(1)=2,\\,n\\ge 1"] ["answer-field-66bae46d-9a2a-5dcb-a638-46a59f8b52be" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-field-66bae46d-9a2a-5dcb-a638-46a59f8b52be" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] ["answer-field-66bae46d-9a2a-5dcb-a638-46a59f8b52be" :answer-field/correct "answer-2b933277-b836-55ae-9b21-a1a99505fdc8"] ["answer-field-66bae46d-9a2a-5dcb-a638-46a59f8b52be" :answer-field/choices "answer-2b933277-b836-55ae-9b21-a1a99505fdc8"] ["answer-field-66bae46d-9a2a-5dcb-a638-46a59f8b52be" :answer-field/choices "answer-9c6698c3-0e55-55e1-a6c5-bc756af04932"] ["answer-field-66bae46d-9a2a-5dcb-a638-46a59f8b52be" :answer-field/choices "answer-71f17afc-b6a1-50e6-8314-cf085641ebf2"] ["answer-field-66bae46d-9a2a-5dcb-a638-46a59f8b52be" :answer-field/choices "ans